{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC工商領導人峰會／尖東聖誕燈飾亮燈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261117.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式及專題研討。另外，尖東聖誕燈飾亮燈，民政及青年事務局局長麥美娟、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩等擔任主禮嘉賓。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:05:18.405566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:32:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:32.911179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:50.377181+00:00","content_hash":"55585a1d77b6f6fa9cd757b4a0e539deff0ef970ad9f968551e12c2b65403713","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}